exports.description:
The input driving a drag. The first three mirror `PointerEvent.pointerType`;
`keyboard` and `script` are the keyboard and scripted sensors; `native` is the
HTML5 bridge (OS files). Activation constraints are chosen per kind (D10).

props.description:
The presentation (preview, shifts, indicators, drop animation);
default `{}` = the kit's defaults (clone preview, gap shifts). `false` draws
nothing: the app styles the drag through the `data-dnd-*` hooks (D124).

